tion scare, and the ad-platform complex is already de-rating (numbers above). The hedge genuinely expresses the regime.\n\nNet: the macro regime read may be sound, but the instrument selection argument \u2014 the core of the pitch \u2014 is weak. You're buying a mid-range ratio after a year of outperformance, on a single-commodity flip condition (Brent <$72), with a -2.7% stop that a Sunday-night ceasefire gap in Brent will not honor. Conviction 6 is fair-to-generous; I'd score it 5 until the ratio offers an actual dislocation entry or the thesis survives a crude pullback to $75 intact.",
